The grid map is excluded below — it's a dense 10x10 test fixture, not a
map meant to read clearly on screen, and its tight spacing (80px between
grid neighbours) makes the clearance check meaningless there.

~property no_node_sits_on_a_foreign_arc
    fc.assert(fc.property(
      fc.constantFrom(
        makeClassicMap, makeSplitMap, makeDiamondMap,
        makeCircuitMap, makeMandalaMap,
      ),
      (mapFn) => _nodesClearOfForeignArcs(mapFn()),
    ))

